        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-06T07:33:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is fine, but out of curiosity, would it work if this code was:\n\n    when(mConnectivityManager.registerNetworkAgent()).thenReturn(new Network(102));\n\nand then later you used:\n\n    verify(mConnectivityManager, timeout(...)).registerNetworkAgent(...);\n\n? That seems a bit easier to read than the synchronization scheme that uses the ConditionVariable. LGTM either way.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1076,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 1076,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "8f4d1ec282c971a27e4c804bf658bf7e1598b7d0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1b70ed9d_d8a385df",
        "filename": "tests/net/java/com/android/server/connectivity/VpnTest.java",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 1076,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-06T08:32:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that would probably work, because I think it\u0027s very likely Mockito\u0027s implementation has synchronization that would make it work, but then again I\u0027m not too sure what are the guarantees of synchronization that are offered by verify(). I don\u0027t really think there are any, which means it remains strictly speaking undefined whether this can be relied on. Even though realistically I don\u0027t see it stopping working because of all the tests it would break.\n\nI also like the explicit synchronization in this test, making very clear what is it we\u0027re synchronizing on. I agree that what you wrote reads easier, but the synchronization is also implicit meaning if that\u0027s where your problem is you\u0027ll have a harder time.\n\nSo on balance I don\u0027t think it\u0027s all that different, so I\u0027ll keep what I have to save myself some more testing work :)",
      "parentUuid": "ce515bda_18f56ede",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1076,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 1076,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "8f4d1ec282c971a27e4c804bf658bf7e1598b7d0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
